---
const metodoImgUrl = "/metodo.jpg";
---

<section id="metodo" data-reveal="up" class="relative">
  {/* Glow suave general */}
  <div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 -z-10 opacity-70" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="absolute -top-10 left-1/2 h-72 w-72 -translate-x-1/2 rounded-full bg-[#6D5EF7]/10 blur-3xl"></div>
    <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 h-72 w-72 rounded-full bg-[#FF7CC8]/10 blur-3xl"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-6xl gap-10 md:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_minmax(0,1fr)_auto] md:items-center">
    {/* IZQUIERDA: título */}
    <div class="flex items-center justify-center md:justify-start" data-reveal="left">
      <h3
        class="font-serif font-black tracking-tight leading-[1.05]
               text-[34px] sm:text-[44px] md:text-[5rem]
               title-silhouette-sharp title-silhouette-sharp-anim"
      >
        Mi Forma de trabajo
      </h3>
    </div>

    {/* CENTRO: texto */}
    <div
      class="rounded-3xl bg-white/70 p-6 ring-1 ring-black/5 shadow-sm
             transition-transform duration-300 ease-out hover:-translate-y-1"
      data-reveal="right"
    >
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2">
        <p class="text-xs font-extrabold tracking-[0.14em] text-[#6D5EF7] uppercase">
          Mi forma de trabajo
        </p>
        <span class="h-1 w-1 rounded-full bg-black/20"></span>
        <p class="text-xs font-medium text-[#6B6B6B]">Proceso y encuadre</p>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-6 space-y-6 text-[17px] leading-relaxed text-[#6B6B6B]">
        <p data-reveal-item style="transition-delay: 120ms">
          Mi práctica clínica se basa en una{" "}
          <span class="font-semibold text-[#2E2E2E]">escucha comprometida</span> y{" "}
          <span class="font-semibold text-[#2E2E2E]">respetuosa</span>, orientada a acompañar procesos de{" "}
          <span class="font-semibold text-[#2E2E2E]">reflexión</span> y{" "}
          <span class="font-semibold text-[#2E2E2E]">autoconocimiento</span>. El trabajo terapéutico se construye de manera conjunta,
          en un vínculo que se sostiene en la{" "}
          <span class="font-semibold text-[#2E2E2E]">confianza</span>, la{" "}
          <span class="font-semibold text-[#2E2E2E]">constancia</span> y el{" "}
          <span class="font-semibold text-[#2E2E2E]">cuidado</span>.
        </p>

        <p data-reveal-item style="transition-delay: 220ms">
          Cada proceso es{" "}
          <span class="font-semibold text-[#2E2E2E]">singular</span> y requiere un{" "}
          <span class="relative inline-block font-serif text-[20px] sm:text-[22px] font-extrabold text-[#6D5EF7]">
            <span class="relative z-10">tiempo propio</span>
            <span class="absolute -bottom-0.5 left-0 right-0 h-2 rounded-full bg-[#6D5EF7]/20" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          </span>
          .
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    {/* DERECHA: foto */}
    <div class="mt-8 md:mt-0 md:justify-self-end md:self-center" data-reveal="right">
      <div
        class="relative inline-block w-[220px] sm:w-[240px] md:w-[240px] lg:w-[280px] xl:w-[320px] overflow-visible rounded-[14px] bg-white p-2
               shadow-[0_6px_18px_rgba(15,23,42,0.12),0_20px_50px_rgba(15,23,42,0.14)]
               [transform:rotate(var(--tilt))] transition-[transform,box-shadow] duration-[250ms] ease-out
               hover:[transform:translateY(-2px)_rotate(calc(var(--tilt)*0.4))]
               before:content-[''] before:absolute before:-top-3 before:left-8 before:h-6 before:w-24 before:rounded-[6px]
               before:bg-gradient-to-br before:from-white/70 before:to-white/30 before:border before:border-white/60
               before:shadow-[0_2px_6px_rgba(0,0,0,0.15)] before:backdrop-blur-[2px] before:rotate-[-8deg]
               before:z-20 before:pointer-events-none
               after:content-[''] after:absolute after:-bottom-3 after:right-8 after:h-6 after:w-24 after:rounded-[6px]
               after:bg-gradient-to-br after:from-white/70 after:to-white/30 after:border after:border-white/60
               after:shadow-[0_2px_6px_rgba(0,0,0,0.15)] after:backdrop-blur-[2px] after:rotate-[7deg]
               after:z-20 after:pointer-events-none
               tilt-r"
      >
        <img
          src={metodoImgUrl}
          alt="Imagen del método de trabajo"
          class="block w-full rounded-[12px]"
          loading="lazy"
        />
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
